                <pb facs="0715" n="611" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg611"/>

                <head>Treaty between the United States and Italy amending Article 3 of the Treaty of
                    Commerce and Navigation of February 26, 1871; text</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, February 25, 1913; ratification
                        advised by the Senate, February 26, 1913; ratified by the President, March
                        1, 1913; ratified by Italy, June 21, 1913; ratifications exchanged at
                        Washington, July 3, 1913; proclaimed, July 3, 1913.</hi>
                </p>

